{
  "title": "Maui 2010 - Blue Hawaiian Helicopter TOUR",
  "slug": "maui-2010-helicopter-tour",
  "date": "2010-07-14",
  "section": "travel",
  "summary": "Certainly one of the best way to explore the Hawaiian islands is by helicopter! This time (my wife and I have toured Maui by air before) we decided to check out the area of Maui we were staying in as well as jump over to the island Molokai and it was well worth it! In addition to seeing the cliffs where the entrance to Jurasssic Park was filmed we also saw a couple of manta rays, a sea turtle, and of course tons of gorgeous Hawaiian scenery!",
  "body": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Certainly one of the best way to explore the Hawaiian islands is by helicopter! This time (my wife and I have toured Maui by air before) we decided to check out the area of Maui we were staying in as well as jump over to the island Molokai and it was well worth it! In addition to seeing the cliffs where the entrance to Jurasssic Park was filmed we also saw a couple of manta rays, a sea turtle, and of course tons of gorgeous Hawaiian scenery!",
